WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:03.020
We have a voicemail number on this show.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:07.630
Here's an interesting voicemail about something
people have written to me about before my

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:08.630
disclaimers.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.730
Let's take a listen to what the caller has
to say.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:14.430
Hey, David, I've got a New Year's resolution
for you.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.430
Yes.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:18.850
How about no more of the disclaimers for idiots?

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:19.850
All right.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.460
You don't have to explain every time that
Chris Wallace is not our friend.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:30.020
The Lincoln Project is not our friend Fox
News or not because blah, blah, blah, blah,

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.020
blah, blah, blah.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:41.059
If people on the left are too dumb to ever
accept that maybe someone outside of their

00:00:41.059 --> 00:00:47.530
tribe has something reasonable to say from
time to time, do you really want them to be

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.589
a subscriber?

00:00:48.589 --> 00:00:50.350
So this is completely fair.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.850
So they're referring to yesterday I did a
segment where Chris Wallace said one thing

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:59.370
that made sense and I kind of gave this disclaimer
where I said, I'm not saying Fox News is trustworthy.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.260
I'm not saying these are our friends.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.070
All I'm saying is Chris Wallace said one thing
that that makes sense.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:09.090
The reason I do those disclaimers is for my
own sake, it's actually selfish.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.330
I'm being selfish when I do it.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.170
And I'll explain why.

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:17.789
If I talk about different plans for health
care and I say there's Medicare for all and

00:01:17.789 --> 00:01:20.690
there's this other type of money, here are
different types of plans.

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:25.420
If I don't clarify, I'm not saying I want
for profit health.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.420
Right.

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:32.350
If I don't clarify that, I will get no exaggeration,
100 emails clogging my inbox from people saying,

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.390
David, how dare you, how dare you?

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.890
Support for profit health insurance.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:42.149
So the reason I give the disclaimer and I
say, hey, I'm telling you something that exists.

00:01:42.149 --> 00:01:44.770
I'm not advocating for it.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.810
I will get 100 emails when I do the disclaimer.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:49.609
I only get 40 now.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:53.500
It's merely agreed that I don't it's not even
greed.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.250
It's a concern for my own inbox.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.299
That's why I do the disclaimers.

00:01:58.299 --> 00:01:59.780
I agree that it's sad.

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.920
I do, but it is what it is.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:07.159
And if you saw what was going on with my inbox
every day, you would also understand it.

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.550
We have a great bonus show for you today.

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:14.330
Get instant access by becoming a member at
Join Pakman dot com.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.769
I'll speak to you on the bonus show.

